docs {
  ## Accept Order — Already Active

  Tests accepting an already ACTIVE order.
  Replace `ACTIVE_ORDER_UUID` with an order that is already in ACTIVE status.

  Expected: 400 Bad Request — "Order cannot be accepted because it is ACTIVE"
}
